{"additions":921,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nCloses #154.\n\n- **Shared renderer** — `markdown_to_lines` (plus the GFM table fitting helpers) moves from `github::panes::detail_view::view` to a new `core::ui::markdown` module; the GitHub and Projects detail views now use it from there, unchanged.\n- **Files preview** — `.md` / `.markdown` files (extension-only detection) are rendered: headings, emphasis, lists, task lists, code and GFM tables fitted to the pane width, reflowed on resize. A YAML front matter block at the top is kept verbatim in a dim style. The pane title shows `markdown` / `raw`.\n- **`m` toggle** — a new view-level `ToggleMarkdown` action (same pattern as the Projects page's `NextProject`) flips rendering for the session, from any pane.\n- **Config** — top-level `markdown-preview \"render\" | \"raw\"` (default `render`) picks the default, mirroring `image-preview`; added to the merge allowlist and `Config::validate`.\n- Scrolling, search, `e` / `o` / `O` behave as before; the truncation marker is kept in rendered mode.\n\n## Docs / demo\n\n- README + docs/README.ja: Files section paragraph and `m` key row.\n- Guide: Files chapter \"Markdown previews\" section and `markdown-preview` in the Config Reference (en/ja, kdl examples CI-verified).\n- `tape/demo-files.tape`: README.md now has a table, and the demo toggles `m` render → raw → render; GIF re-recorded.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `core::ui::markdown` keeps the 9 moved renderer tests.\n- New preview tests: extension detection, toggle + scroll reset, `raw` default, front matter kept verbatim, reflow on width change.\n- Loader test for `markdown-preview` validation. 353 tests green, clippy clean.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w","changedFiles":18,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-03T05:06:00Z","deletions":568,"headRefName":"feat/files-markdown-preview","labels":[],"number":155,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABL91-sg","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThere is a confirmed scroll-clamping bug in the Files Markdown preview path that can leave the preview blank after reflow/resize until the scroll position is corrected.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nThis PR adds rendered Markdown support to the Files view preview, reusing the existing GitHub/Projects markdown renderer by moving it into a shared `core::ui::markdown` module, and introduces config + keybindings to toggle rendered vs raw preview.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Extract shared Markdown renderer into `src/core/ui/markdown.rs` and update GitHub/Projects detail views to use it.\n- Render `.md` / `.markdown` files in the Files preview (with YAML front matter shown verbatim and tables fitted/reflowed to pane width), plus an `m` toggle for rendered/raw.\n- Add `markdown-preview \"render\" | \"raw\"` configuration support, and update docs + demo tape/GIF accordingly.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tape/demo-files.tape | Updates the demo script to show Markdown rendering and the `m` toggle. |\r\n| src/projects/panes/detail.rs | Switches Projects detail pane to use the shared markdown renderer. |\r\n| src/github/panes/detail_view/view.rs | Removes the local renderer and imports the shared `markdown_to_lines`. |\r\n| src/files/state.rs | Wires config default + view-level `ToggleMarkdown` action into the Files page. |\r\n| src/files/panes/preview.rs | Implements Markdown rendering, width-based reflow caching, and toggle behavior in the preview pane. |\r\n| src/core/ui/mod.rs | Exposes the new `core::ui::markdown` module. |\r\n| src/core/ui/markdown.rs | New shared Markdown renderer (including fitted GFM tables) with moved tests. |\r\n| src/core/keymap.rs | Adds `ViewAction::ToggleMarkdown` and help text. |\r\n| src/core/config/merge.rs | Allows `markdown-preview` at the top level during config merge. |\r\n| src/core/config/loader.rs | Adds parsing/validation + tests for `markdown-preview`. |\r\n| README.md | Documents Markdown preview behavior and the `m` key in Files view. |\r\n| docs/README.ja.md | Japanese docs update for Markdown preview behavior and `m` key. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-files.md | Adds a “Markdown previews” section and the `m` key to the Files guide. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/config-reference.md | Documents the new `markdown-preview` top-level config node. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-files.md | Japanese guide update for Markdown previews + `m` key. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/config-reference.md | Japanese config reference update for `markdown-preview`. |\r\n| assets/demo-files.gif | Updates the recorded demo GIF (LFS pointer change). |\r\n| assets/default.kdl | Adds `markdown-preview \"render\"` default and binds `m` to `ToggleMarkdown` in Files view. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 18/18 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 1\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-03T05:08:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"c525e0a6f3523e85749ab65c7c3f441d36040f0b"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABL94K9Q","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-03T05:14:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"263f2ff2d856201f1965c5797ddbcc17a27814dc"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABL95SSQ","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🔵 Needs a closer look\n\nThe Files preview Markdown feature appears to miss the requirement for preview content search to operate on the rendered text, indicating an unmet acceptance criterion for #154.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n### Suppressed comments (1)\n\n**Previously missed (1)** — in code that hasn't changed since the last review.\n\n**src/files/panes/preview.rs:153**\n* Issue/PR requirements mention that `/` search should work in the preview and match the rendered Markdown text, but the preview pane still has no search integration: `PreviewAction` has no `Search(SearchAction)` variant, `PreviewPane` does not implement `collect_search_matches`/`jump_to_match`, and the default config binds `preset \"search\"` only for `dir_list` (so search is limited to file names). If content search in the preview is intended, the preview pane needs to expose search matches based on `markdown_lines(width)` when `markdown_active()` (and raw `lines` otherwise) and add the search preset/bindings for the preview pane.\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 18/18 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0 new\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>","submittedAt":"2026-09-03T05:17:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"263f2ff2d856201f1965c5797ddbcc17a27814dc"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:24:40Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33718727660/job/100533312254","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:24:48Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:15:29Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33718012394/job/100531168190","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:14:12Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:14:45Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33718012412/job/100531168283","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:14:12Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:15:24Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33718012394/job/100531168348","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:14:14Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:16:29Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33718012394/job/100531168421","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:14:12Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:16:29Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33718012394/job/100531646020","name":"upload","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:16:29Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:24:40Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33718727660/job/100533318500","name":"publish","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:24:50Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:15:26Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33718012412/job/100531168241","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:14:13Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:15:41Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33718012412/job/100531168134","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:14:12Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:24:40Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33718727660/job/100533313029","name":"homebrew","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:24:49Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"}],"title":"✨ Files view: render Markdown files in the preview"}
